# =============================================================================
# 开项 OpenXiang —— Docker 构建上下文排除清单（v3-docker-compose-runtime-foundation）
#
# 目标：构建上下文只携带复现镜像所需内容，绝不携带本机敏感/大体积产物。
# 约定：排除后如需保留某个 example/config 文件，用 `!` 显式放行（见 env 段）。
# =============================================================================

# --- VCS 与协作元数据 ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.agents
.claude
.codex
.kimi
.kimi-code
.mimocode
.opencode
.impeccable
.playwright-mcp
.headroom
.tokensave
.codebase-memory
.mcp.json

# --- 环境变量：真实 env 一律不进构建上下文，仅保留 example 模板 ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!.env.compose.example
.env.compose

# --- 宿主依赖与构建缓存（镜像内重新 frozen install，禁止复用宿主产物） ---
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
apps/backend/build
apps/backend/.adonisjs
packages/sdk/dist

# --- SQLite 数据库与本机测试库 ---
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/*.sqlite.bak

# --- 运行时资料：上传附件、报表导出、本机 secret（容器内由 named volume 承载） ---
apps/backend/storage/uploads
apps/backend/storage/secrets
deploy/secrets

# --- 日志 ---
**/*.log

# --- 测试与覆盖率产物 ---
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/frontend/.nyc_output

# --- 本机工具缓存与临时目录 ---
.pnpm-store
.uv-cache
.uv-tools
.tmp
.tmp-*
.writing-index.sqlite

# --- 与镜像构建无关的仓库内容（文档/规范/进度/夹具/E2E/本机杂项） ---
docs
openspec
progress
fixtures
packages/e2e
baidu-wangpan-parse
李计忠著作PDF
# 仅排除仓库根的截图/导出杂项；apps/frontend/public 的静态资源照常进入构建上下文
/*.png
/*.html

# --- 顶层脚本只在协作主机/目标机门禁中使用，镜像构建不需要 ---
scripts
